Derived work
------------

Scene Agent is a fork of the Higgsfield Blender add-on ("higgsfield_blender"
1.5.50), Copyright (C) 2026 Higgsfield Inc., released under GPL-3.0-or-later.
Most of the viewport UI — the Skia renderer (`skui/`), the widget vocabulary
(`hfui/`), the composer and chat surfaces, and the supporting plumbing — is
their work, and the per-file `SPDX-FileCopyrightText` headers name them as the
copyright holders of those parts. Those notices must stay: the licence that
permits this fork is the same licence that requires the attribution.

What this fork changes is the ownership of the agent. The upstream add-on
signed in to a Higgsfield account and drove Blender from their hosted agent.
This fork removes the account entirely — the OAuth device flow, the token on
disk, the SDK client, the outbound bridge to their MCP worker, the Amplitude
telemetry, the auto-updater and every feature that billed against a Higgsfield
balance — and answers the same chat with a coding CLI running on the user's own
machine.

